    "text": {
     "en": "We use many things every day, like a pencil to write and a bag to carry books. Have you wondered how they work?\nMeera and Dhruv explore something new every weekend. This Sunday Meera spun a coin and said, Watch this!\nCan all objects spin? Make a list of things that can spin. Collect a coin, bangle and others and spin them.\nRecord what you observe, what you wonder and what you think. A coin shakes as it slows down. Why?\nA machine is a tool that makes work easier. Simple machines include levers, wheels and pulleys."
    }
